  "limitations": [
    "LOCOMO is a bounded evidence-retrieval benchmark and does not represent every prompt or every Sol model.",
    "No answer model was called, so the report does not establish answer accuracy, refusal correctness, latency, token use, or credits for Sol.",
    "The archived BGE reference returns 10 rows while the candidate retrieves 20 before rendering.",
    "The full quality sweep used SQLite stores read-only; PostgreSQL behavior and multi-tenant concurrency are outside this artifact.",
    "Fresh-process timing does not flush the operating-system file cache and uses one fixed conv0 query on one Windows machine.",
    "Cross-encoder logits are ranking values, not calibrated confidence scores; threshold behavior was not evaluated.",
    "The product renderer enforces a character heuristic, so exact o200k_base usage exceeded 768 tokens on this corpus.",
    "The ONNX graph and tokenizer are external artifacts and are intentionally not committed to the repository."
  ]
